  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Make the sauce: mix the yoghurt, juice and zest of the orange, olive oil, chopped spring onion, dill, thinly sliced radishes, salt and pepper."
    },
    {
      "text": "Squeeze the coarsely grated zucchini and onion very well to drain the liquid."
    },
    {
      "text": "Add the flour, eggs, parsley, mint, kashkaval, salt and pepper and mix well."
    },
    {
      "text": "Heat oil for frying in a pan, spoon in the batter and fry on both sides until golden. Place on paper towel."
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve the fritters with the sauce."
    }
